WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.870
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.390
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.790
Why are Tadase-kun and Ikuto fighting?

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.510
Perhaps it's simply fate.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.150
Fate is but a sumptuous trap; anguish unend-

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.110
Hey, look, it's Ikuto!

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:20.470
Today we'll hear the story of Ikuto-san's past.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.000
All right then, it's time for our weekly ritual.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.540
Try it out!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.690
Doki!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:43.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:49.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:56.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:03.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.160
Stand! Bow!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:10.530
And once that's done,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:23.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:29.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:36.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:44.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:59.860
Episode 100
The Birth of Two Character Transformations!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:06.310
Why... Why do they have to fight?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.980
I guess because they're boys...

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:14.940
This... just isn't right.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:20.450
I don't understand why they're fighting if they don't want to.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.510
Is it because I'm a girl?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:32.140
But even so... There must be a way for me to fight, too.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.490
Dumpty Key! Humpty Lock!

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.170
Lend me your power!

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.340
What is this? What's going on here?

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.080
What's happening?!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.360
I don't know! A stream of light is...

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.240
It has an incredible amount of energy!

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.610
What's creating this light?

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.130
Where am I?

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.790
Amu-chan!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.140
Miki? Su?

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.610
Tadase-kun!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.680
What's happening?

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.480
I have no idea.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.820
I was just suddenly enveloped in a bright light.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.990
Hey, where's Ikuto?

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.340
Amu-chan, look over there!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.890
Ikuto!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.640
I want to see my mommy...

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.430
They said it's important for Mom to get some rest.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.780
It would be too upsetting for her to see us right now.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:18.150
That's not fair! I'll be lonely without Mommy!

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.030
Utau, you have to stop crying.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.370
Kids like us can't cry.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:27.700
If we cry, other people will pity us.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.400
What's pity?

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.930
It means they'll feel sorry for us.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.830
Is that a bad thing?

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.010
These are Ikuto's memories.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.760
Brother!

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:53.520
We'll be taking care of Ikuto-kun and Utau-chan starting today.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.600
You're gonna live with us?

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:05.120
The poor things have been through so much.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.740
Tadase, be extra kind to them, all right?

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.480
Poor things...

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.430
And they're still so young...

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:18.960
It's so sad...

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.150
Ikuto...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.130
It's not that bad.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.400
Come see this.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:39.530
We all have to leave the nest and make it on our own sometime.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:42.440
The only difference is whether it happens sooner or later.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.960
It's Yoru's egg!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.460
He's about to be born!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.350
What is this thing?

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.620
Ikuto-kun!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.660
Your mother asked me to hold on to this while she's in the hospital.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.000
That's my dad's violin...

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:41.080
I think perhaps you should be the one to have the violin your father cherished so much.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.650
But it's his fault that Mom and Utau are unhappy.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.930
I could never play that violin.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.150
Who are you trying to convince?

00:06:56.130 --> 00:07:00.170
Do you think it made your father happy to leave his family like he did?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.970
What is happiness, anyway?

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:06.990
And what is unhappiness?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:13.240
Wouldn't you like to know more about your father?

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.320
Why don't we look for him together?

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.940
Then we'll know what he truly felt.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.520
Brother, where are you going?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.850
Please, wait!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:38.840
Broth-

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.820
Tadase, Utau, I'm sorry!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.270
Ikuto-niisan...

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:06.070
If that's how you were feeling, you could've told me!

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:08.610
Anything he said would've sounded like an excuse.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.670
That's probably what he was thinking.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:17.470
Those first little miscommunications sure can end up becoming complex misunderstandings...

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.150
Snow?

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:26.980
You don't have any money?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.650
I can't find my wallet anywhere.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:34.020
You must have dropped it somewhere!

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.740
No need to worry, though. My passport's safely in my pock-

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.610
And where will we eat and sleep today, huh?!

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:45.370
We've talked to a ton of people but we don't have a single clue about my dad!

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.700
Ikuto-niisan?

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:49.800
Isn't that a little out of character?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.150
Sheesh...

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:31.740
Amazing, Ikuto-kun! Now we won't have to worry about our traveling money!

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.100
Let's go.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.300
So mean.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.350
I always thought Tsukasa-san was more reliable...

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.520
Instead, it's hard to tell which one is the adult.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:53.340
Is that my dad?

00:10:53.650 --> 00:11:00.030
Aruto-san traveled around Europe while he was a student, performing to earn money along the way.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:03.430
Apparently, he even worked here at this woman's shop.

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.710
I recognized the tone of those notes the second I heard them.

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:10.150
I knew it was Aruto-san's violin.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:14.910
Business boomed thanks to the people who came to hear his performances,

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:19.110
and he even ended up marrying one of the customer's daughters.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.190
As she grew older, unfortunately, she closed down the store.

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:32.350
But if she were to meet your father again, she would want to thank him for making everyone so happy.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:40.400
This violin didn't bring unhappiness to anyone...

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.610
But now, it's...

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:53.100
Good, let it out, my proud little stray.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.230
Let go of that pain you've held inside all this time.

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.340
Everything will be okay.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:07.040
You don't need anyone to pity you or tell you what to do anymore.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.630
Ikuto-kun...

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.890
You're already...

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.250
Free-nya!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.590
Free?

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.340
Yeah!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:31.860
You think Tsukasa-san knew what was going to happen all along,

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:34.190
and that's why he took Ikuto on that trip?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.730
I bet he did!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.270
We finally found you.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.060
Ikuto...

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.690
Ikuto-kun!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.100
You really gave us quite a hard time.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.220
Who are you?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:55.910
Where's my dad?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.550
I am your father.

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.320
Your mother is married to me now.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.090
Easter is mine.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:08.490
From now on, you will obey my orders.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:13.910
What's happening?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.370
Ikuto's memories are flowing out.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.090
You have no need for music!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.060
If I let you become like that father of yours, it'll be nothing but trouble.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.740
Ikuto, I'm going to live in the agency's apartment.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:39.330
Those people aren't my father or mother.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:45.900
Ikuto, you have no freedom.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:50.980
You know what'll happen to those you'd leave behind if you fled, correct?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.750
Yes, I do.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:03.940
He obeyed the Director all to protect Utau-chan and his mother.

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:07.950
Betty? This memory is from...

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:18.350
Ah... You'd rather go to sleep under the warm sun in your favorite garden,

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.750
than in some cold hospital bed.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:28.200
Wait here, I'll bring your scarf.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.580
What really happened that day?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.860
Sweet dreams, Betty.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:19.450
Betty didn't die because Ikuto played the violin.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:25.100
She was actually breathing peacefully as she listened to it.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:28.000
Yes, in a warm, sunny spot.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:32.050
You know, I'm sure your grandmother's illness wasn't Ikuto's fault either!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.280
Brother, I...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:37.060
What are you lazying about for?

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.450
All eggs except the Embryo are rubbish!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:40.640
Destroy them!

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:52.900
Every time he destroyed an egg... Every time he hurt someone...

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.610
He held that pain inside.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:01.790
But... that's not the person Ikuto wants to be!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:12.380
I get it now. I know what I have to do.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.760
Honey, I'm home...

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.530
This is...

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.950
Amu-chan.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.140
Dia!

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:54.970
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.180
Character Transformation: Amulet Diamond!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.770
This aura...

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:15.440
It's Dia!

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.790
Amu-chan...

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.010
Tadase!

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:31.210
Dia, you've come back to me!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.920
I'm always with you, Amu-chan.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:37.260
I'm the radiance that sleeps deep within you.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:42.940
As long as you focus on steadfastly searching for your answer,

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:46.900
I'll always be on your side!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.060
Dia...

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.100
So let's find the answer, together!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:58.030
I'm small and weak...

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.870
I don't think I can fight as well as a boy...

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.890
Then again, I have a different kind of strength!

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:39.070
Wish Upon a Star:

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.380
Shooting Star Shower!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.350
Ikuto...

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.980
I understand now what you've wanted all along.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:40.170
You want me to embrace your pain and suffering.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:45.540
If you really have to fight, it's the least I can do.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:50.690
Amu-chan, do you understand now?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.680
This is your answer.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.790
Amu.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.350
Ikuto!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.410
Where are we?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.890
Ikuto...

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:15.920
Um...

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.420
Guess I had you worried there, Yoru.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:23.380
Ikuto!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:26.260
Hey, guys.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:30.780
Ran, Miki, Su!

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:41.450
Is this... a Character Transformation?

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.130
Character Transformation: Amulet Fortune!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:08.280
Character Transformation: Seven Seas Treasure!

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:33.220
You sure do seem determined.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:39.270
So even if you screw up, it'll somehow turn out all right.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:46.640
How about you just trust in yourself?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.100
Take that first step and everything will work out fine.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:23:00.030
Even if people see through your cool exterior, keep marching on.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:09.110
Look up at the blue sky and everything will reset!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.750
Take it easy! Take it easy!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:23.290
Try to relax those shoulders and clear your mind.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:30.000
The more you do it, the easier it'll get, so keep taking it easy.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.200
Ride the flow of time and you'll be...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.000
Shining! Shining! Shining!

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:52.610
It's a new Character Transformation!

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:54.190
Amu-chan's amazing!

00:23:54.190 --> 00:23:54.990
Thanks...

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:56.870
What's the matter, Amu-chan?

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.650
I wish I knew why Easter's doing this.

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:02.790
What could they want to do with the Embryo?

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:04.930
Maybe they want to make a wish!

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:08.720
Perhaps they want to eat some yummy food!

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:10.260
Uh, doubt it.

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:12.360
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:15.320
The Torn Picture Book! The Tragic Secret!

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:17.400
Hey, look who's over there!
